I know I answered this a while back, so I'll just Google that up...

If you are (punished and Burdened) or Stressed, you will try to drop gear
until that condition is not true. You can't drop body armor, boots,
gloves, amulets, or rings (the rationale is that taking them off takes
time); or any object which you couldn't normally drop (like a cursed
weapon or loadstone). If you can't drop enough gear (objects are tried in
a random order but the process does try all of them eventually) you drown.

Hence it's pretty hard to actually drown - but of course dropping gear
would be an infernal nuisance, so in practice you'd want to avoid that.

